                                "sense_id": "14a3d1f1-06e3-3d13-a87d-0c0ffceafb99",
                                "text": "I was once, I remember, called to a patient who had received a violent contusion in his tibia, by which the exterior cutis was lacerated, so that there was a profuse sanguinary discharge […]"
                            },
                            {
